+3.5.3 LOGO Type Definition
+
+   To: ietf-mime-directory@imc.org
+
+   Subject: Registration of text/directory MIME type LOGO
+
+   Type name: LOGO
+
+   Type purpose: To specify a graphic image of a logo associated with
