+    VERSION:4.0
+    FN:Simon Perreault
+    N:Perreault;Simon;;;ing. jr,M.Sc.
+    BDAY:--0203
+    ANNIVERSARY:20090808T1430-0500
+    GENDER:M
+
+
+
+Perreault                    Standards Track                   [Page 56]
+
+RFC 6350                          vCard                      August 2011
+
+
+    LANG;PREF=1:fr
+    LANG;PREF=2:en
+    ORG;TYPE=work:Viagenie
+    ADR;TYPE=work:;Suite D2-630;2875 Laurier;
